  "description": "Determined to secure a successful career after university, Jia decides to join “Pi Kappa Omega,” the most prestigious club on campus. But as she undergoes the grueling first stage of initiation, her charismatic professor, Max Devlin, introduces her to unconventional methods that push her to her limits, both physically and emotionally. As Jia struggles to keep up with the intense pain and pleasure Devlin gives her, she must come face to face with her deepest desires. Will Jia be able to withstand the initiation and be accepted into the club, or will it prove too much for her to handle?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
